{"Risk of race conditions when updating retryCount - concurrent cron executions might both try to increment retryCount; should use atomic increment instead of reading and writing back": 0.5904631018638611, "Deletion condition unintentionally applies to all methods - the deleteMany where clause's retryCount branch does not restrict to SMS, so any WorkflowReminder of any method with retryCount > 1 will be deleted": 0.9871188402175903, "Logging should include reminder.id and retryCount for easier debugging when errors occur": 0.13932375609874725, "Missing logging when retryCount is incremented and when a reminder is deleted due to retryCount threshold": 0.16941729187965393, "Missing unit/integration tests for: scheduling fails once (retryCount increments to 1), scheduling fails twice (retryCount increments to 2 and reminder removed), and ensuring other reminder methods are not deleted when retryCount > 1": 0.4225181043148041, "Consider adding an index on retryCount if deleting by retryCount frequently": 0.22945576906204224}